 "description": "Status-discriminated contract for the /feed/all envelope of the producer pinned at b95d1c3c73f720fe71fa139a7964af118fa139dea344fbdb7fa42dbd4619406e. Variants are source-backed: ok (full snapshot), error (sparse poll-exception shape OR no-quote shape \u2014 data fields ABSENT, not null, beyond the listed optional keys), quarantined (future-quote rejection), starting (pre-first-poll). CONSUMER GATE: interpret market data ONLY when status == 'ok'; every other status is no-data regardless of shape. updated_at is the producer BUILD-START time, not a completed-response receipt. Scope: price/status contract \u2014 the top level and the gamma block are binding; flow/vanna_charm/iv/positioning are declared as objects whose detailed fields are descriptive (typed from the supplied capture), not a frozen analytical schema.",
 "oneOf": [
  {
   "$ref": "#/$defs/ok"
  },
  {
   "$ref": "#/$defs/error"
  },
  {
   "$ref": "#/$defs/quarantined"
  },
  {
   "$ref": "#/$defs/starting"
  }
 ],
